  "releaseNotes": "Picks up PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.2.1, whose XML parser computes the string value of a large element in linear time (an internal id→node index replaces a per-child linear scan) — relevant to any query that atomizes or takes the string value of an element with many children. No PhoenixmlDb.XQuery code change; requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.2.1. Backward-compatible; no public API removed. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
